  "speakingPlannedMaximumSeconds": 414.768,
  "cache": [
    {
      "key": "fbe23c00330a26ff2fb57a1b",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "姑妈今晚住我们家，客房还没整理。",
      "sha256": "21b3fc3dc792418170482b14f6dd892ef71cd9bac8fb7c7e0bfb5cb9ac368dae"
    },
    {
      "key": "b120077acc90c6bfd8a37f0b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "你去车站接她吧，房间我来收拾。水果弟弟已经买好了。",
      "sha256": "77ffab185fd3221eb92a8e83f06026aaa124c4069ed7999979a4fd9d4097f758"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d00ba1d042507d88ee562c5",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我现在去车站。",
      "sha256": "785b778a5de3166dfbd20fd9559b8466014cc284bb2ea50aed722f34de4eeb13"
    },
    {
      "key": "34e89f8d03ace2b111d8dc37",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第1题。",
      "sha256": "3895df58b8b6ce61365216490dcb339db3aa7ef168eef8d2098c469073a4cdc2"
    },
    {
      "key": "a2961bfcb96e494ee2da6313",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "舅舅的火车六点到站，是不是六点就吃晚饭？",
      "sha256": "f9f6e0eb120f7501f522ef54cf4d3feec17fc0dbad6bf76a73f9019f05036ada"
    },
    {
      "key": "9f8f0667d03be80cfc463f11",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "不行，从车站到家还要四十分钟。我们七点开饭，先让他把行李放好。",
      "sha256": "5345cac684bff8007d40e9026eac2622575bc008f76e533e6670f31ea842f75c"
    },
    {
      "key": "966bdc512495a86e6157211e",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好，七点一起吃。",
      "sha256": "a6cefcfb460ded6be88efdc6f02523618a84b03413d9d4c5459b12aa11ed1cba"
    },
    {
      "key": "1741fb60958696627ba5f0ed",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第2题。",
      "sha256": "39f2c75a46983608745be0da5fe2130f1e77b5cd88f7b9b3928a0a06485a2744"
    },
    {
      "key": "e7dab079d8eb381aa022fd9a",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我们平时各自在家吃饭，每个月的第一个和第三个星期日，才去奶奶家一起吃。我每个月去两次，不是每个星期都去，也不是每天去。",
      "sha256": "b496a64706dcbe2dbf7887113482ad77909d90c9d70014ab32bc1d90b6ee4330"
    },
    {
      "key": "97e9c8d06f3e0171388ee24b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第3题。",
      "sha256": "74d7fdba0fd9fae146470574deadbd8616eca796fece18aaf8190b3792f4225e"
    },
    {
      "key": "2d1709e886102b0dc19b0bde",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我周日下午有空，想骑一段平路，不想上坡。",
      "sha256": "c9f7078c15bc8d82bd4204c3c0a4f6eadb45b0671296e9b4c03a46edfdca01e0"
    },
    {
      "key": "693f13a747e3d114b2568056",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "山边的路一直能骑，可是有坡；学校里的平路周日不开。河边的平路下午开放。",
      "sha256": "faeb121d5cd765be822e6b29295dc7bc6c54ff714cef477292302d6810becb86"
    },
    {
      "key": "2de0e7db5741406df3869ad8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那就去河边。",
      "sha256": "9854ba377b4ae29eba40a5ddf4691a3a469b800b7ac3860d2aef585189664168"
    },
    {
      "key": "b25d3caab3d72c3d0347de4b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第4题。",
      "sha256": "cc38e6d168e0664b2b8f98558b26288abcea294390f4e9aa13d8f457ef5a7046"
    },
    {
      "key": "281dde99b69f7b50c3f772c9",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "小林以前骑车总要和朋友比快。昨天他没有看用时，慢慢骑了一圈，还停下拍了几张照片。回家以后他说，这次比以前轻松，以后还想这样骑。",
      "sha256": "90bb458c833e8aa0f227cb4256d10ed9493952b4aba03593351edcecc568ac39"
    },
    {
      "key": "c5b1d9675aba74bbd668ea00",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第5题。",
      "sha256": "057a4202f7d25216a190a84d6056c30f42be93ac60cdc21879a97aaaf19252d9"
    },
    {
      "key": "ff5ebef5f272704eb400c925",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我们在老菜市场门口见吗？",
      "sha256": "2d5b69eedd232fe296b6c4ed9f012c9275fee6e07c2ad4310b7ea4e60a60c5d7"
    },
    {
      "key": "43d42f3931b2273155e520db",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天要去的是社区新市场，在邮局旁边。老菜市场已经关了，别去错。",
      "sha256": "d71e45119d53ffc8dbc48fa0fcf37f1fed830a606733289d683cefef0cca9ebf"
    },
    {
      "key": "56bdce8244dadaec73ba6ec8",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "明白，我在新市场东门等你。",
      "sha256": "36d02dbf126c672b120d5dad6391ad013e112726585c5e9444d379e61042ba44"
    },
    {
      "key": "5e6c5b336701fe2c48b7fa2f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第6题。",
      "sha256": "fcc5b0fabad8f1fa79148054a17b60ac8d2cb351d57ed0d5eb073df550e3ee93"
    },
    {
      "key": "db6672dae559d27eb0dd43b8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "公交车去市场要绕路，得坐半个小时。",
      "sha256": "c411464a6348aedca57d72f043ad64e4004effbd286279007ecc2a1d9e70bfb3"
    },
    {
      "key": "84b58909a47bc5df18f8a3ba",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "从这里走过去只要十分钟，我今天也没带自行车。",
      "sha256": "3a94cc94d71d395f6fb0fb06324125fc7c689b09dd65f15ce09f0c2731fcc10d"
    },
    {
      "key": "bee5fdc2b4d8b5e80c911b06",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那我们走路去，买好东西再看怎么回来。",
      "sha256": "8f279498bfbff5e30591dcec10c74fde001387995eedb8780fec8b74fb795831"
    },
    {
      "key": "79e0bdfd02236c1d4253adc0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第7题。",
      "sha256": "5151859d99f51fb43c1c4ba74a72c7d8898fd12ebdb151ca350243f27169a52c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b06138d6f9820a1335eb595",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "市场南门前修路，从车站出来怎么走？",
      "sha256": "d1bf10c8dffdf90cef133e7944ed7cca05d1f7c74caad85c1b59fa2337aa4d5d"
    },
    {
      "key": "4bd0c2db41da16624cafe65f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "先沿河向北走，到了小桥再过河。过桥后就是市场北门，不要从南门硬走过去。",
      "sha256": "77bcb4db9c2e849cd696098515340355789f9f6a98d0cdf9c9b9fbc65799444a"
    },
    {
      "key": "5a9e20c041b360da9df469fa",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，先往北。",
      "sha256": "73214813937baa584c572f6d223edb04ae1a0efdb7b565408e14be421b03fdcb"
    },
    {
      "key": "b431efe26b8c6cc712ef43b8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第8题。",
      "sha256": "65ff1f952179bc643f6b488a3150eee5a21667f5901053151fd7aeb53f0c7786"
    },
    {
      "key": "78e8c8eb7b651f4421c75455",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "去市场的班车九点四十到，只收现金。公交车九点五十到，可以刷交通卡。",
      "sha256": "c5bdcb5f0b0eeacaa65455fc0facc3a4713217ff6435f9c84bf805e8a66e73c0"
    },
    {
      "key": "f586125917b4a196efb77086",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我十点前要到，身上只有交通卡，没有现金，坐公交吧。",
      "sha256": "66a2da5d3e3fb16819a13cb1f7e65e9f42a5852240c5cf2c256921bffe36c873"
    },
    {
      "key": "76f9b7034e5801a6360f40bd",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第9题。",
      "sha256": "439f37e4f9738e7ac1dc180f588ae4ed900731c0623d4038b9f3533da20c0ada"
    },
    {
      "key": "adec1074da030ede325f59c5",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "周日风太大，带客人去放风筝的事怎么办？",
      "sha256": "b8c40f71ba7c11487af9a3033b212b8cadbaff0c56bef99246bd9bc8722cdbd0"
    },
    {
      "key": "43fd96fb6486c128293a55fc",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "先在家教大家做纸风筝吧，做好留着，下星期天气合适再出去放。",
      "sha256": "32eb17cf8d064865b00ca37d138c0b3a0701d79b90e30dcf20fbea068f4623a1"
    },
    {
      "key": "443ff98bb44015240f24b1e2",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，周日就在家做。",
      "sha256": "a9e717131a7639f650a45b29441ffacff7460fc090519d546f5bb0e5a1ef23cb"
    },
    {
      "key": "86d64da7bc27367110de5cb7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第10题。",
      "sha256": "a443b83201af7bae91780e167c2fcd53ef523b448bf77dd4ad6b238de2e582d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "4c69aa9e5ca3ccaed9f8de70",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "姑妈和叔叔两家都来，每个人都送一盒饼干吗？",
      "sha256": "432acb33601cd582e7a1ec5f1ef97be42dabb9baa2c7ddbb7d05b0ff1d341f30"
    },
    {
      "key": "082a2cb05d11d36c4f1e4aef",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "不用按人数送，每家一盒，一共两盒。茶叶另外带一袋，留在家里大家一起喝。",
      "sha256": "e17ca9e7c4297b76f75d96764cad2bef42512379e4abf883102c750da97895c2"
    },
    {
      "key": "63d3dd3f27ad85dca9aa0606",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第11题。",
      "sha256": "09609165ce7b5b5bbc80de6236e7726415e2ab45d65241e1ca3c75ec4a697f32"
    },
    {
      "key": "7d34672c85fa234459cf7596",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "这三种杯子，你想送哪一种给叔叔？",
      "sha256": "72acef6ab205a72acedff7073713af0aa19522a6af88d32f8c853c6f25aac847"
    },
    {
      "key": "aaef832589c93c4d0e3f8658",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "叔叔喜欢小杯子，而且一定要有把手。这只小号带把手的就合适，大号和没把手的都不要。",
      "sha256": "7fab672ba547331491aa3769f319229b5a0a20ca4db69da56429bdf3d8bfbc02"
    },
    {
      "key": "2dbff9b332f7edc61b4c3c18",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第12题。",
      "sha256": "f25ea7d43ed9f81b7dd1af25fa0339498c7d458e79931122755e838f8d314a83"
    },
    {
      "key": "cbd0fe2529e23cd11c7b472b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "茶叶一小袋六块，三袋散着买十八块。装成这套礼盒要二十五块，盒子和包装都算在里面。",
      "sha256": "ffe6c2e557be0895d6d129bdd013ab12b618f34827c93fae19d6377d9dd89f7e"
    },
    {
      "key": "307034b42565b548fea69457",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我要这套包好的礼盒，送给客人。",
      "sha256": "5a0f0e66e31f6bb4a4fd5f110cc2a931e0c83743f75bc96858164e1744389b35"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec1acc6c51d958bc6eb290a5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第13题。",
      "sha256": "e6515323a9eef38c0320124c2e99d81f002d229d597de7f44a76008521622c43"
    },
    {
      "key": "4d57b4d36f8b78743eb81489",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "客人明天坐火车走，想带一件轻又不容易碎的礼物。",
      "sha256": "8262d0d7a0b86f9751573178b3b48cbe8efb2302ce2c09ce6c0298d3085fbcec"
    },
    {
      "key": "bc2d94a3aba05411c150e814",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "玻璃杯不合适，大花瓶也重。围巾很轻，折起来就能放进包里，不用担心打碎。",
      "sha256": "bd0f49acdb74a3ff0dd7f0934af2937e69ad40d1ab7eb164bb788793657626a7"
    },
    {
      "key": "95e8cc86dee76159d7ff87fe",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "那选围巾。",
      "sha256": "d4ad2004f0df5db9f5fa601b8aea83e67adca75e86fa6a2777270ca9fb488421"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a9458d981e42c448c56e5d7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第14题。",
      "sha256": "3c248ca1222db546caafa3ccef0afeb1d63689c8e501a91b906f7c38012bc8f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "c260529b88bbea9bf8eb898c",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "客人六点来，你几点能到家？",
      "sha256": "bad29fa48a2c0133a3940224cf274e8ed5239298491f4f3b98486e0683241893"
    },
    {
      "key": "3a15a1c642977117cab9f9b9",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我六点才到，来不及准备。",
      "sha256": "230ffbab4815062f0645ac4fdf87394a5074370d1499b8ebe107f13c7a7b9e3f"
    },
    {
      "key": "4eba54c7e3707af4e7e5430b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我五点就到。那我先把客厅椅子摆好，你回来陪客人聊天，晚饭弟弟已经订了。",
      "sha256": "9d765f39c7c0df4e3b26f3b46df3fdefc438b20507e12f2cb6057ab20c957f63"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d1b8c046279c5b498214791",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第15题。",
      "sha256": "774136cf8893575562e62fc53ca824d970e119df2986004fbc9a795341529ed7"
    },
    {
      "key": "06a138b9938da2105fa0e493",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "早上外面几乎没有风，可是预报说下午风会大很多，晚上也不会马上停。今天气温变化不大，想骑车的同学要注意下午的风，别只看早上的天气。",
      "sha256": "1f9dcc3bb46c2a09e73ccc8552d30fc8d809bf75d6f31c27b8d2ad2b445feef2"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cffbf1010d1e54023057ea9",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第16题。",
      "sha256": "6cbe22b4463ef0127dbcb5957919648ee9b071c97d70d0b85edf327b6a0071df"
    },
    {
      "key": "68e4deea1d9b891e930de8fa",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天为什么把写贺卡的桌子搬进屋？外面也没有下雨啊。",
      "sha256": "4b323678b082b0bc6c0a23863fb9c960da89a29df7ebef8193fb06fae9f5dd2a"
    },
    {
      "key": "d856758fd11c888437e08cc9",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "风太大，纸一直被吹走。我们在屋里写完，再拿出去给客人看，时间还是三点。",
      "sha256": "150902fab11617e278577cfa12443e5bfad07b572874a1bb12014f4a7799b624"
    },
    {
      "key": "61f4d2e4e5f3e0536be36453",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第17题。",
      "sha256": "7b303e3cdea4e6b338b981ca7d27218c5da50fd4e2ca1cb297c3ba0853fbff6b"
    },
    {
      "key": "893649c0196c42a7d458fee2",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "明天骑车在广场集合，那里能装水吗？",
      "sha256": "b08b51fe64fca564801c1c4a9c6ab6fd7c77e94720f46dc658526946e84f1709"
    },
    {
      "key": "4d21d6c12d6ac53d8edba71a",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "没有饮用水，来以前要在家装好一瓶。路上商店也没开，别到了广场才找水。",
      "sha256": "598dc2c4f1d96670d31aba94b00a8db06ce9bd3dc99de337d66e7ddfddf47257"
    },
    {
      "key": "f96b66fea62b5e0e8e09b119",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我出门前装好。",
      "sha256": "c5ef83dec8463e54418aa1f0cdd41234be2eeb2675ac30f6be55a8dec5f7be1d"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e9092b1191d42999a9f695d",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第18题。",
      "sha256": "b0832c56a97774c35b538f689f08bf8314e263e14ab809871867bcdede27a70b"
    },
    {
      "key": "82cc1c2bc39c25b41b4e76bd",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "去年中秋，我们先给住在外地的姐姐打电话。吃完晚饭，全家一起分月饼。后来月亮出来了，才到阳台拍照。姐姐看了照片，说好像也和我们坐在一起。",
      "sha256": "dedf14c22346db6b032d19af33ef1deb927d99c6d9ec4dfd96b5c8e1c0a4df2c"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee9540a1a810afba0a3a7056",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第19题。",
      "sha256": "91a1a230e642a4906da5e058c485a56cf6a1c77b67c899338da1843b7db5066e"
    },
    {
      "key": "bd5acf998e30010e749998c4",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "哥哥出差不能回来，奶奶起初说今年中秋少了一个人。后来我们接通视频，哥哥也在屏幕那边吃饭。奶奶一直笑，还请我们把手机放近一点儿，好让她看清哥哥。",
      "sha256": "53903b02837a20035ca58f1b4fe13f412e501fb7612e5f869df9ffb1fc404c18"
    },
    {
      "key": "689adfbaa5b63ac16b96aac6",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第20题。",
      "sha256": "f2a7aa65a74fad7dc9d19d81d6990ac99260287106ff304656efb599e75400e1"
    },
    {
      "key": "92be713b27b4a37a485ba0ed",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "家里明天有客人来，我们还需要买什么？请说一种东西，也可以说已经准备好了。",
      "sha256": "6c7b23b0f2cf8de87feee593fab87ba00af42fe8fb1303cac343c182a28a8fe4"
    },
    {
      "key": "7eb01901729f4ce398b37aa5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "招待客人，你想选水果还是点心？也可以选别的东西。",
      "sha256": "87b3ccbd4bbfa4404b3a62e0feb41e9d766666e628d66d0059ba28dc0b7fbbf4"
    },
    {
      "key": "787a0759bbf12b2bfe8b98d0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "这个选择有什么好处？给我说一个和客人有关的理由吧。",
      "sha256": "fd2fa3a5b0f299fed51c1a883991a825dc9842030da94d1516bae8e7425676f5"
    },
    {
      "key": "732ef551138527ce0e61acca",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "市场今天四点就关门，原来五点去来不及了。你准备怎么调整？",
      "sha256": "9a7b4041db90f5d31db115d0537a40748e2811619744f8405ddd53eafd38c69d"
    }
  ]
}
